Hi Site,

We have checked for the OSA account, kindly find below our findings:

1. On 6th March 2025, Pricing team has done a backdated change for OSA bonus interest from 4.2% to 4.05% with effective from 21st Feb 2025. Due to this, backdated changes happened for the OSA account and it resulted in AA.INTEREST.ACCRUALS table corruption.
2. Interest accruals for Bonus interest property has stopped accruing from 20th Feb 2025.
3. We have checked for Jan month and can confirm bonus interest was paid.
4. From Feb month onwards the bonus interest was not paid and we need to calculate manually and pay the customer.

We have already raised a TSR this issue with product vendor Temenos and there are waiting for connectivity to test environments for testing the correction. Currently the connectivity issue is being checked by BOQ management.

We will let you know, once we receive the correction and apply for the impacted OSA contracts.

Hope this clarifies, with this update we are marking the ticket as resolved. Kindly revert back for any further assistance.

Thanks,
Akhilesh

