HL.FLEX.MBR.PKG.SIM-API--20250618
HL.FLEX.MBR.SIM-API--20250618

Hi Mat,

These FTs are raised as part of re-lodgement. If customer has any outstanding scheduled payment bill and it has multiple arrears fee, then as part of re-lodgement on 14th day, system is trying to settle outstanding scheduled payment bill, and all the outstanding arrears bills up to nominated account balance. If nominated account balance has sufficient balance to settle three outstanding arrears fee, system will debit $75 from nominated account, if it has sufficient balance to settle 1 then system debits $25 from nominated account and credits to the loan.

For this account 000371131 on 5th June, system has settled few bills as part of re-lodgement.
For this account 014423219 ON 14th May, system has settled few bills as part of re-lodgement.

As per current expectation whenever relodgement is happening, system should collect only 1 arrear fee amount from the customer's nominated account, but in our case it is collecting for multiple arrear fee bills. For this issue. we have already raised “TSR-985741 - Conti of TSR-982731- System is charging multiple missed repayment (arrears) fees during re-lodgement if loan has multiple unsettled arrears fees” with Product Vendor Temenos.

Temenos had given fix for this issue, but fix did not work in unit testing. We have re-opened this ticket and Temenos has asked few more details which we have provided them. We will discuss with Temenos and provide further details if they need any.

Hope this clarifies, with this update we areking the ticket as resolved. Kindly revert back ofr any further assistance.

Thanks,
Akhilesh


