If any ticket comes to you for analysis, when and why post box got removed from customer address, please refer TASK0857328




Hi Khushbu,

1. Two incoming credit requests were received in the same file, targeting to credit the same loan.
2. The system attempted to process both transactions simultaneously.
3. This loan has 2 future dated activities. If any activity triggers / repayment comes to the loan in case if loan is having any future dated activity, system reverses and replays to the future dated activities.
4. After first transaction succeeded, system triggered a reverse and replay of future-dated activities.
5. The second transaction failed during its attempt to reverse and replay the same future dated activities. Failure occurred because the record IDs of future-dated activities had changed after the first transaction, resulting in a RECORD missing error.
6. As a result, the second FT was returned by the system.

Hope this clarifies, with this update we are marking the ticket as resolved. Kindly revert back for any further assistance.

Thanks,
Akhilesh


