AASSURE

1. First open the TSR and check the contracts. Copy and paste all the contracts in SL.
2. Now check if AA.INTEGRITY.CHECK.ONLINE(mainline routine) is available, if not make a PGM entry for it.
3. Run the routine AA.INTEGRITY.CHECK.ONLINE and select required S or M. S if single contract, M if multiple contracts and give the save list in which
   you saved the contracts.
4. Now open the file AA.INTEGRITY_ONLINE.REPORT and check if all the contracts are listing in this report.
5. Apply the correction provided.
6. Again do steps 3 and 4.
	i. if no contracts are listed then correction is applied to all.
	ii. if correction is applied to few contracts, then reopen the TSR for the contracts(correction not applied).
7. Move the contracts for which correction applied successfully into Prod with a nurd(Ticket).



