21/07/2025

New users DAO should be updated in below table then only user can create contact notes

PW.PARTICIPANT S CONTACT.NOTE.OFFICER

****************************************************************************************************************************************************************************

If COB is on hold then system date will be still on previous date even though 12:00 am is crossed, if any FT is posted at that time then Credit and Debit value dates will be passed as current date i.e. after 12:00 date...but processing date will be still old date i.e. before 12:00 am as system date is still old one. AAA related to this FT will be having current date.

In below example Ft was posted on 12:00:49 am on 20250701, since COB was on hold...after processing FT was given Credit and Debit value dte as 20250701 and processing date as 20250630.

